{%- comment -%}
  The one star shape used everywhere: the overall rating, the inline rating by
  the price, and the distribution rows. Sized by --star-size on the element, so
  nothing has to restate its dimensions.

  @param class - extra classes for the svg

  Usage: {% render 'icon-star' %}
{%- endcomment -%}
<svg class="star-icon{% if class %} {{ class }}{% endif %}" viewBox="0 0 20 19" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M10 0l2.9 6.2 6.6.9-4.8 4.8 1.2 6.8L10 15.5 4.1 18.7l1.2-6.8L.5 7.1l6.6-.9z"/></svg>
